Open index.html in a browser. The layout follows the observed VanillaRec homepage structure: top navigation, notification/login/download controls, large illustrated hero, feature rows, featured rooms, and current happenings section.

Images are loaded from public asset URLs on vanillarec.net, so an internet connection is required. These are reference images belonging to their respective owners. Replace them with RewindRecRoom-owned images before public release if you do not have permission to reuse them.

This is a front-end visual prototype. Login, notifications, downloads, rooms, and events are placeholders and are not connected to live services.

